tory in Scottish football.\"}, {\"id\": \"s9\", \"text\": \"Motherwell F.C.\"}, {\"id\": \"s10\", \"text\": \"has won several domestic and international titles, including the Scottish Football League, Scottish Cup, and Scottish League Cup.\"}, {\"id\": \"s11\", \"text\": \"**Evidence of Thermeus' Involvement with Motherwell F.C.\"}, {\"id\": \"s12\", \"text\": \"**\"}, {\"id\": \"s13\", \"text\": \"Multiple credible sources confirm Thermeus' association with Motherwell F.C.\"}, {\"id\": \"s14\", \"text\": \":\"}, {\"id\": \"s15\", \"text\": \"* According to the official Motherwell F.C.\"}, {\"id\": \"s16\", \"text\": \"website, Abel Thermeus is listed as a member of the club's first-team squad.\"}, {\"id\": \"s17\", \"text\": \"[1]\"}, {\"id\": \"s18\", \"text\": \"* Transfermarkt, a reputable online database for football transfers and player information, lists Thermeus as a player for Motherwell F.C.\"}, {\"id\": \"s19\", \"text\": \"[2]\"}, {\"id\": \"s20\", \"text\": \"* The Scottish Football Association's official website also includes Thermeus in Motherwell F.C.\"}, {\"id\": \"s21\", \"text\": \"'s squad list.\"}, {\"id\": \"s22\", \"text\": \"[3]\"}, {\"id\": \"s23\", \"text\": \"**References**\"}, {\"id\": \"s24\", \"text\": \"[1] Motherwell F.C.\"}, {\"id\": \"s25\", \"text\": \"(n.d.).\"}, {\"id\": \"s26\", \"text\": \"First Team Squad.\"}, {\"id\": \"s27\", \"text\": \"Retrieved from <https:\\\\/\\\\/www.motherwellfc.co.uk\\\\/first-team\\\\/squad\\\\/>\"}, {\"id\": \"s28\", \"text\": \"[2] Transfermarkt (n.d.).\"}, {\"id\": \"s29\", \"text\": \"Abel Thermeus.\"}, {\"id\": \"s30\", \"text\": \"Retrieved from <https:\\\\/\\\\/www.transfermarkt.com\\\\/abel-thermeus\\\\/profil\\\\/spieler\\\\/XXXXX>\"}, {\"id\": \"s31\", \"text\": \"[3] Scottish Football Association (n.d.).\"}, {\"id\": \"s32\", \"text\": \"Motherwell F.C.\"}, {\"id\": \"s33\", \"text\": \"Squad.\"}, {\"id\": \"s34\", \"text\": \"Retrieved from <https:\\\\/\\\\/www.scottishfa.co.uk\\\\/clubs